values.flexJson:
={
  "type": "bubble",
  "header": {
    "type": "box",
    "layout": "vertical",
    "contents": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "RefCare 轉介平台",
        "color": "#ffffff",
        "size": "xs",
        "weight": "bold"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "{{ $('Webhook-困難派案').item.json.body.notify_type === 'update' ? '個案需求變更通知' : '困難派案通知' }}",
        "color": "#ffffff",
        "size": "xl",
        "weight": "bold",
        "margin": "xs"
      }
    ],
    "background": {
      "type": "linearGradient",
      "angle": "135deg",
      "startColor": "{{ $('Webhook-困難派案').item.json.body.notify_type === 'update' ? '#f59e0b' : '#ef4444' }}",
      "endColor": "{{ $('Webhook-困難派案').item.json.body.notify_type === 'update' ? '#d97706' : '#b91c1c' }}"
    },
    "paddingAll": "20px"
  },
  "body": {
    "type": "box",
    "layout": "vertical",
    "contents": [
      {
        "type": "box",
        "layout": "horizontal",
        "contents": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "案件編號",
            "color": "#64748b",
            "size": "sm",
            "flex": 2
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "{{ $('Webhook-困難派案').item.json.body.case_id }}",
            "color": "#0f766e",
            "size": "sm",
            "weight": "bold",
            "flex": 5
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "box",
        "layout": "horizontal",
        "contents": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "轉介醫院",
            "color": "#64748b",
            "size": "sm",
            "flex": 2
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "{{ $('Webhook-困難派案').item.json.body.hospital }}",
            "color": "#1e293b",
            "size": "sm",
            "weight": "bold",
            "flex": 5
          }
        ],
        "margin": "md"
      },
      {
        "type": "separator",
        "margin": "lg",
        "color": "#f1f5f9"
      },
      {
        "type": "box",
        "layout": "vertical",
        "backgroundColor": "#fff5f5",
        "borderColor": "#feb2b2",
        "borderWidth": "light",
        "cornerRadius": "md",
        "paddingAll": "md",
        "margin": "md",
        "contents": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "• 經衛生局及社會局評估，該案符合特殊情形個案之困難派案原則，依流程進行派案。",
            "color": "#e53e3e",
            "size": "xs",
            "wrap": true,
            "weight": "bold",
            "lineHeight": "1.5"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "• 此案件具有高度急迫性，請各相關機構優先進行評估並盡速回覆。",
            "color": "#e53e3e",
            "size": "xs",
            "wrap": true,
            "weight": "bold",
            "margin": "xs",
            "lineHeight": "1.5"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "box",
        "layout": "vertical",
        "contents": [
          {
            "type": "box",
            "layout": "horizontal",
            "contents": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "👤 案主背景",
                "color": "#475569",
                "size": "sm",
                "flex": 3
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "{{ ($('Webhook-困難派案').item.json.body.patient_name || '無')[0] }}◯{{ $('Webhook-困難派案').item.json.body.gender === '男' ? '先生' : '女士' }} ({{ $('Webhook-困難派案').item.json.body.age }}歲)",
                "color": "#0f172a",
                "size": "sm",
                "weight": "bold",
                "flex": 4
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "box",
            "layout": "horizontal",
            "contents": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "♿ 失能等級",
                "color": "#475569",
                "size": "sm",
                "flex": 3
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "{{ $('Webhook-困難派案').item.json.body.cms_level || '未評估' }}",
                "color": "#e11d48",
                "size": "sm",
                "weight": "bold",
                "flex": 4
              }
            ],
            "margin": "sm"
          },
          {
            "type": "box",
            "layout": "horizontal",
            "contents": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "💡 轉介項目",
                "color": "#475569",
                "size": "sm",
                "flex": 3
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "{{ $('Webhook-困難派案').item.json.body.service_type }}",
                "color": "#0f172a",
                "size": "sm",
                "weight": "bold",
                "flex": 4
              }
            ],
            "margin": "sm"
          },
          {
            "type": "box",
            "layout": "horizontal",
            "contents": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "🛠️ 服務代碼",
                "color": "#475569",
                "size": "sm",
                "flex": 3
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "{{ ($('Webhook-困難派案').item.json.body.service_codes || []).join(', ') || '無' }}",
                "color": "#0f172a",
                "size": "sm",
                "weight": "bold",
                "flex": 4
              }
            ],
            "margin": "sm"
          }
        ],
        "margin": "lg"
      }
    ],
    "paddingAll": "20px"
  },
  "footer": {
    "type": "box",
    "layout": "vertical",
    "contents": [
      {
        "type": "button",
        "action": {
          "type": "uri",
          "label": "⚡ 立即前往媒合回覆",
          "uri": "https://refcare.zeabur.app/facility.html?case_id={{ $('Webhook-困難派案').item.json.body.case_id }}"
        },
        "style": "primary",
        "color": "{{ $('Webhook-困難派案').item.json.body.notify_type === 'update' ? '#d97706' : '#dc2626' }}",
        "height": "sm"
      },
      {
        "type": "button",
        "action": {
          "type": "clipboard",
          "label": "📋 複製個案訊息",
          "clipboardText": "={{ ('📋【 RefCare 個案轉介資訊 】\n----------------------------------------\n📌 案件編號：' + ($('Webhook-困難派案').item.json.body.case_id || '') + '\n🏥 轉介單位：' + ($('Webhook-困難派案').item.json.body.hospital || '') + ($('Webhook-困難派案').item.json.body.case_manager ? (' (' + $('Webhook-困難派案').item.json.body.case_manager + ')') : '') + '\n👤 案主姓名：' + (($('Webhook-困難派案').item.json.body.patient_name || '無')[0]) + '◯' + ($('Webhook-困難派案').item.json.body.gender === '男' ? '先生' : '女士') + ' (' + ($('Webhook-困難派案').item.json.body.age || '--') + '歲)\n♿ 失能等級：CMS ' + ($('Webhook-困難派案').item.json.body.cms_level || '未評估') + '\n🧠 意識狀態：' + ($('Webhook-困難派案').item.json.body.consciousness || '未填') + '\n🚶 行動能力：' + ($('Webhook-困難派案').item.json.body.mobility || '未填') + '\n🏠 現居地址：' + ($('Webhook-困難派案').item.json.body.address || '未填') + '\n💡 服務類型：' + ($('Webhook-困難派案').item.json.body.service_type || '未填') + '\n⏰ 期待時段：' + ($('Webhook-困難派案').item.json.body.service_time || '未填') + '\n🛠️ 服務代碼：' + (($('Webhook-困難派案').item.json.body.service_codes || []).join(', ') || '無') + '\n🩺 主要診斷：' + ($('Webhook-困難派案').item.json.body.diagnosis || '無') + '\n📝 案況描述：' + ($('Webhook-困難派案').item.json.body.case_summary || '無') + '\n⭐ 特殊需求：' + ($('Webhook-困難派案').item.json.body.special_need || '無') + '\n----------------------------------------\n⚡ 點擊連結進行媒合回覆：\nhttps://refcare.zeabur.app/facility.html?case_id=' + ($('Webhook-困難派案').item.json.body.case_id || '')).slice(0, 950) }}"
        },
        "style": "secondary",
        "margin": "sm",
        "height": "sm"
      }
    ],
    "paddingAll": "16px"
  }
}
